  "highlights": [
    {
      "text": "Apple Watch Series 12 uses Ceramic Shield 2 front glass and a zirconia back, replacing the Ion-X front glass and sapphire rear sensors on earlier base models.",
      "startSeconds": 127
    },
    {
      "text": "The redesigned Health app is easier to navigate, with clearer Insights, Longevity and Browse tabs for finding tracked data.",
      "startSeconds": 184
    },
    {
      "text": "Series 12 tracked heart rate every five seconds in this review, compared with every three to eight minutes on Series 10.",
      "startSeconds": 315
    },
    {
      "text": "The Health app adds camera-based balance and flexibility assessments that run locally on the phone, though strict positioning can interrupt the tests.",
      "startSeconds": 506
    },
    {
      "text": "Series 12 adds automatic Shazam, sound recognition, 15-second Live Rewind and Siri Recap; always-listening features raised the reviewer's privacy concerns.",
      "startSeconds": 728
    },
    {
      "text": "The reviewer got two days of battery life and 25% charge in 15 minutes, but could not reproduce Apple's claimed 10-watt charging.",
      "startSeconds": 834
    }
  ],
